msgid "可加载内核模块设计与实施计划"
msgstr "Loadable Kernel Module Design and Implementation Plan"

msgid ""
"状态：设计于 2026-10-24，模块机制、构建与分层功能验收已完成。以下核对项记录 交付范围；编译、宿主回归、来宾结果和既有失败分别说明。源码调查基线为 "
"``f0498b6e05d45adb14723127f8549fe564a48cc8``。"
msgstr ""
"Status: designed on 2026-10-24; module mechanisms, builds, and layered functional acceptance are "
"complete. The checklist below records delivery scope; compilation, host regressions, guest "
"results, and existing failures are reported separately. The source investigation baseline is "
"``f0498b6e05d45adb14723127f8549fe564a48cc8``."

msgid "目标与约束"
msgstr "Goals and Constraints"

msgid ""
"用户已选择 Linux 风格机制，模块针对 ReliefNT 编译，不要求直接加载 Linux 原版二进制模块。为适合独立加载的生产部件提供 ``n/y/m`` 配置：``y`` 静态 "
"链接，``m`` 生成可加载 ELF64 ``ET_REL`` 文件，``n`` 不构建。defconfig 将 目前内置的生产组件全部保持为 ``y``；测试模块默认关闭。"
msgstr ""
"The user chose a Linux-style mechanism, with modules compiled for ReliefNT rather than direct "
"loading of upstream Linux binaries. Provide ``n/y/m`` for production components suitable for "
"independent loading: ``y`` links statically, ``m`` produces loadable ELF64 ``ET_REL`` files, and "
"``n`` omits the build. defconfig keeps all currently built-in production components at ``y``; test"
" modules are disabled by default."

msgid ""
"``CONFIG_MODULES=y`` 默认提供加载能力，并不意味着已有组件默认设为 ``m``。 ``CONFIG_MODULE_UNLOAD=y`` "
"提供受引用计数保护的卸载。首版不提供强制加载、 强制卸载、模块压缩或签名验证配置；不得显示尚未实现的配置项。 导出的系统调用遵循 x86_64 Linux ABI；内核模块机制本身不是 POSIX"
" 接口。"
msgstr ""
"``CONFIG_MODULES=y`` enables loading by default, without setting existing components to ``m`` by "
"default. ``CONFIG_MODULE_UNLOAD=y`` provides reference-count-protected unloading. The first "
"version provides no forced loading/unloading, compression, or signature verification "
"configuration; unimplemented options must not be displayed. Exported syscalls follow the x86_64 "
"Linux ABI; the kernel module mechanism itself is not a POSIX interface."

msgid ""
"本计划只描述内核实现。ReliefOS 的配置委派、模块工具、initramfs 内容、 镜像、安装器和 RPR 计划位于父仓 ``Documentation/process/kernel-"
"modules-plan.rst``，不得移入内核构建图。 实施时使用 executing-plans 逐项验证；若获准委派，遵守用户指定的 GPT-6.1-Terra / "
"Max。当前已授权实现；提交、推送或建立分支须另获明确授权。"
msgstr ""
"This plan covers only kernel implementation. ReliefOS configuration delegation, module tools, "
"initramfs contents, images, installer, and RPR planning belong in the parent's "
"``Documentation/process/kernel-modules-plan.rst`` and must not enter the kernel build graph. Use "
"executing-plans to verify items during implementation; if delegation is authorized, follow the "
"user's GPT-6.1-Terra / Max specification. Implementation is currently authorized; commits, pushes,"
" and branch creation require separate explicit authorization."

msgid "方案与边界"
msgstr "Approach and Boundaries"

msgid ""
"只让普通设备驱动生成外部文件，无法支持根磁盘和根文件系统设为 ``m``。 把驱动硬编码为不可模块化同样不能覆盖用户要求。因此推荐完整的 Kbuild、模块运行时、子系统注册和 initramfs"
" 启动链。"
msgstr ""
"Generating external files only for ordinary device drivers cannot support ``m`` for the root disk "
"and root filesystem. Hardcoding drivers as nonmodular also fails to meet the user's requirements. "
"A complete Kbuild, module runtime, subsystem registration, and initramfs boot chain is therefore "
"recommended."

msgid ""
"保持内置的启动基础包括 CPU/中断、调度、内存、ELF 执行、syscall、同步、 VFS/块设备注册、PCI/设备注册、基础控制台、初始内存根以及模块加载器。 "
"procfs/sysfs、memfd 必需的 tmpfs 基础及通用 socket/TTY 分发也保留在核心。 这些不是可以把自身也放到磁盘后再加载的部件。"
msgstr ""
"Boot foundations kept built in include CPU/interrupts, scheduling, memory, ELF execution, "
"syscalls, synchronization, VFS/block registration, PCI/device registration, basic console, initial"
" memory root, and the module loader. procfs/sysfs, the tmpfs foundation required by memfd, and "
"generic socket/TTY dispatch also stay in the core. These components cannot themselves be placed on"
" disk to load later."

msgid "拟提供 tristate 的边界："
msgstr "Proposed tristate boundaries:"

msgid "AHCI、IDE/ATAPI、NVMe，e1000，PS/2/USB 设备驱动，串口完整驱动。"
msgstr "AHCI, IDE/ATAPI, NVMe, e1000, PS/2/USB device drivers, and the full serial driver."

msgid "AC97、ES1371、HDA，以及完成通用设备分发与 owner 引用改造后的 sound core。"
msgstr ""
"AC97, ES1371, HDA, and sound core after generic device dispatch and owner references are reworked."

msgid "VMware SVGA/DRM 及 DRM core；基础 framebuffer/启动日志保持内置。"
msgstr "VMware SVGA/DRM and DRM core; basic framebuffer/boot logging remains built in."

msgid "ext2、ext4、FAT、exFAT、ISO9660；公共 ext 辅助代码作为显式依赖。"
msgstr "ext2, ext4, FAT, exFAT, and ISO9660, with common ext helpers as explicit dependencies."

msgid "具有独立注册边界的可选服务，例如内核 HTTP 服务。IPv4/TCP/UDP 核心不为 追求选项数量强行拆为模块；必须先有真实注册和生命周期边界。"
msgstr ""
"Optional services with independent registration boundaries, such as the kernel HTTP service. Do "
"not force IPv4/TCP/UDP cores into modules to increase option counts; real registration and "
"lifecycle boundaries must come first."

msgid ""
"``allmodconfig`` 表示所有具备 tristate 能力的生产组件为 ``m``，不是每个 内核源文件都成为模块。交付前逐个目录列明 ``y-only / y-m-n`` 与理由。 "
"尚未转换的目录不得提前显示可用的 ``m`` 选项。"
msgstr ""
"``allmodconfig`` sets every tristate-capable production component to ``m``; it does not make every"
" kernel source file a module. Before delivery, list each directory as ``y-only / y-m-n`` with "
"reasons. Unconverted directories must not prematurely expose a usable ``m`` option."

msgid "调查基线与主要依赖"
msgstr "Investigation Baseline and Main Dependencies"

msgid "以下描述设计调查时的基线，不能用作当前实现状态；阶段验收另行记录。"
msgstr ""
"The following describes the design investigation baseline, not current implementation status; "
"stage acceptance is recorded separately."

msgid "``Kconfig`` 当前没有功能符号，各目录 Kbuild 全部为 ``obj-y``。"
msgstr "``Kconfig`` currently has no feature symbols, and every directory's Kbuild uses ``obj-y``."

msgid "``kernel/device/registry.c`` 硬编码六个内置驱动；运行时控制返回不支持。"
msgstr ""
"``kernel/device/registry.c`` hardcodes six built-in drivers; runtime control returns unsupported."

msgid ""
"只有上游 ``Makefile.modpost/modfinal/modinst`` 等规则，缺少 ``scripts/mod``、``scripts/genksyms`` 和本地模块运行时。"
msgstr ""
"Only upstream rules such as ``Makefile.modpost/modfinal/modinst`` exist; ``scripts/mod``, "
"``scripts/genksyms``, and a local module runtime are missing."

msgid "根挂载先于普通驱动初始化；``fs/vfs/mount.c`` 直接调用 AHCI/IDE/NVMe 及各文件系统。把对应对象改成 ``obj-m`` 会产生缺失符号或无法启动。"
msgstr ""
"Root mounting precedes normal driver initialization; ``fs/vfs/mount.c`` directly calls "
"AHCI/IDE/NVMe and each filesystem. Changing those objects to ``obj-m`` causes missing symbols or "
"boot failure."

msgid "内核位于低地址，物理直映射在高地址。现有 ``-mcmodel=kernel`` 与任意高 地址模块放置不能直接混用；必须检查重定位范围，不能截断到 32 位。"
msgstr ""
"The kernel occupies low addresses and the physical direct map high addresses. Existing "
"``-mcmodel=kernel`` cannot simply be mixed with arbitrary high-address module placement; "
"relocation ranges must be checked without truncating to 32 bits."

msgid "地址空间与构建格式"
msgstr "Address Space and Build Format"

msgid ""
"首版提议为模块使用 ``-mcmodel=large -fno-pic -fno-pie``，其余 ABI 与核心 一致，在共享 supervisor 高地址区分配模块。这样不为此次功能整体搬迁 "
"内核，不扩大低地址内核洞，也不侵占用户映射。该选择属于本计划的实现建议。 模块窗口拟为 ``[0xffffff9000000000, 0xffffffa000000000)``，与现有前 16 "
"GiB 直映射分离；使用动态虚拟区间和非连续物理页，不新增小型槽池。"
msgstr ""
"For the first version, propose ``-mcmodel=large -fno-pic -fno-pie`` for modules, keeping the rest "
"of the core ABI, and allocate them in shared supervisor high-address space. This avoids relocating"
" the whole kernel, enlarging the low-address kernel hole, or occupying user mappings for this "
"feature. This is the plan's implementation recommendation. The proposed module window is "
"``[0xffffff9000000000, 0xffffffa000000000)``, separate from the existing first-16-GiB direct map, "
"using dynamic virtual ranges and noncontiguous physical pages without a new small slot pool."

msgid ""
"所有地址空间共享该内核页表分支。发布、权限变化与撤销必须同步在线 CPU 的 TLB；既存进程和后续 fork 的进程都必须看见一致映射。 "
"模块映射的页表记录只用于装载器拥有页面、权限变化与释放；不把 ``mm_virt_to_phys`` 放宽为接受模块静态区，更不接受任意高地址或用户地址。"
msgstr ""
"All address spaces share this kernel page-table branch. Publication, permission changes, and "
"revocation must synchronize online CPUs' TLBs; existing processes and later forks must see "
"consistent mappings. Module page-table records serve only loader-owned pages, permission changes, "
"and freeing. Do not broaden ``mm_virt_to_phys`` to accept module static regions, much less "
"arbitrary high or user addresses."

msgid ""
"模块静态区禁止直接充当 DMA 或用户 mmap backing：虚拟连续并不能证明 物理连续。此类缓存必须改用显式、带 owner 的内存对象，对 y/m 共用实现。 DMA API 建议为 "
"``dma_buffer_alloc(device, size, alignment, out)`` 与对应 free，返回 CPU 地址、独立设备总线句柄及实际长度；校验设备 DMA mask，"
" 本平台以满足 mask 的物理连续页实现 coherent 分配，失败明确返回错误。 状态/control 等非 DMA mmap 页使用独立页对象；VMA 逐页持有 backing 与 模块 "
"owner，不以“首地址转换加偏移”推导跨页物理地址。32 位 DMA mask、 跨页映射和设备停止前释放的失败路径必须有测试。"
msgstr ""
"Module static regions must not directly serve as DMA or user mmap backing: virtual contiguity does"
" not prove physical contiguity. Replace such buffers with explicit owner-bearing memory objects "
"shared by y/m implementations. Proposed DMA APIs are ``dma_buffer_alloc(device, size, alignment, "
"out)`` and matching free, returning a CPU address, separate device bus handle, and actual length. "
"Validate the device DMA mask; this platform implements coherent allocation with mask-compatible "
"physically contiguous pages and returns explicit allocation errors. Non-DMA mmap pages such as "
"status/control use separate page objects. VMAs retain backing and module owner page by page, "
"without deriving cross-page physical addresses as “translate the first address plus offset”. Test "
"32-bit DMA masks, cross-page mappings, and failure paths that free before device shutdown."

msgid ""
"实现工具链实际产生的 x86_64 RELA，包括 NONE、64、32、32S、PC32、PLT32、 PC64；未知类型和范围溢出明确拒绝。模块的架构汇编也必须遵守此地址模型。 "
"先在小模块上验证实际编译结果，再转换设备，禁止用忽略重定位掩盖错误。"
msgstr ""
"Implement x86_64 RELA actually emitted by the toolchain, including NONE, 64, 32, 32S, PC32, PLT32,"
" and PC64; explicitly reject unknown types and range overflow. Module architecture assembly must "
"follow this address model too. Verify actual compilation on small modules before converting "
"devices; never hide errors by ignoring relocations."

msgid ""
"加载期间的映射为 RW/NX；校验和重定位完成后分别设为 RX、RO/NX、RW/NX。 模块 text 的其他内核别名不得遗留可写执行通路。首版将所有已分配段保留到 模块卸载，不提供 Linux"
" 内部 ``__init`` API 或初始化段提前回收选项。注册的 回调可能仍引用初始化代码，不能仅因 init 返回就回收。此项是相对于最初设计中 "
"“证明无持久引用后提前释放”的保守实现选择，并非已实现提前回收。失败撤销 映射、依赖和注册，释放前先完成执行者排空。"
msgstr ""
"Mappings are RW/NX during loading and become RX, RO/NX, and RW/NX after validation and relocation."
" Other kernel aliases of module text must not leave writable executable paths. The first version "
"retains all allocated sections until unloading, without the Linux internal ``__init`` API or early"
" initialization-section reclamation. Registered callbacks may still reference initialization code,"
" so init returning alone cannot justify reclamation. This is a conservative implementation choice "
"versus the original design's early freeing after proving no persistent references; early "
"reclamation is not implemented. Failure revokes mappings, dependencies, and registrations, "
"draining executors before freeing."

msgid "接口与生命周期"
msgstr "Interfaces and Lifecycle"

msgid ""
"增加 ``include/reliefnt/module.h``、``moduleparam.h``、``export.h``，提供 "
"``module_init/module_exit``、``MODULE_INFO/MODULE_LICENSE/MODULE_ALIAS``、 参数和 "
"``EXPORT_SYMBOL``。内置与外置使用同一初始化/注册实现；不维护两份 硬编码名单。为上游生成的 ``.mod.c`` 提供最小构建适配头，不宣称兼容完整 Linux "
"内核头文件或驱动源码 API。许可证元数据必须真实。"
msgstr ""
"Add ``include/reliefnt/module.h``, ``moduleparam.h``, and ``export.h`` for "
"``module_init/module_exit``, ``MODULE_INFO/MODULE_LICENSE/MODULE_ALIAS``, parameters, and "
"``EXPORT_SYMBOL``. Built-in and external components share initialization/registration "
"implementations without two hardcoded lists. Provide minimal build adaptation headers for "
"upstream-generated ``.mod.c``, without claiming compatibility with complete Linux kernel headers "
"or driver source APIs. License metadata must be accurate."

msgid ""
"运行时按职责拆为 ``kernel/module/{elf,layout,symbols,params,lifecycle,info}.c`` 和架构侧 "
"``arch/x86_64/module/``，各目录持有 Kbuild。主要接口为："
msgstr ""
"Split the runtime by responsibility into "
"``kernel/module/{elf,layout,symbols,params,lifecycle,info}.c`` and architecture-side "
"``arch/x86_64/module/``, each directory owning its Kbuild. Main interfaces:"

msgid ""
"传入加载器的是内核持有的稳定镜像/文件引用和已复制参数，不能在解析期间 再次解引用用户指针。原子解析、错误回滚和所有权说明须写入相邻 Doxygen。 新框架 ABI 独立于现有 driver "
"API v2；不扩大旧 callback 表来代替符号导出。 旧驱动信息查询可作为适配层保留，不能再保留一套独立加载/卸载引擎。"
msgstr ""
"The loader receives stable kernel-held image/file references and copied parameters, never "
"dereferencing user pointers again during parsing. Document atomic parsing, rollback, and ownership"
" in adjacent Doxygen. The new framework ABI is independent of driver API v2; do not enlarge the "
"old callback table instead of exporting symbols. Legacy driver-information queries may remain as "
"adapters, but not a second independent loading/unloading engine."

msgid ""
"模块状态至少覆盖 COMING、LIVE、GOING。引用分三类：其他模块的依赖、打开 设备、挂载和 VMA 等外部使用引用会阻止卸载；已进入/待执行回调的执行 pin "
"必须在关闭准入后排空；模块自己登记的设备、IRQ、定时器和 DMA 对象属于 清理账本，不能因登记本身产生永不归零的自引用。账本不等于允许忽略回调： mask/STOP、同步取消和 "
"callback drain 完成前不能释放相关代码与数据。 全局表锁只保护短事务，不跨 ELF I/O、初始化、等待或设备回调持有。 禁止重复初始化、同名并发加载、依赖环和卸载中的新引用进入。 "
"init 期间产生的组件注册必须携带 owner 并受状态准入控制；外部任务不能 在没有有效 pin 的情况下进入 COMING 模块。初始化失败时先关闭准入并排空 "
"已进入的执行者，再撤销注册和代码，不能仅因 init 返回错误就立即释放。"
msgstr ""
"Module states cover at least COMING, LIVE, and GOING. References have three classes: dependencies "
"from other modules and external usage such as open devices, mounts, and VMAs prevent unloading; "
"execution pins for entered/pending callbacks must drain after admission closes; module-registered "
"devices, IRQs, timers, and DMA objects form a cleanup ledger and must not create self-references "
"that never reach zero merely by registration. The ledger does not permit ignoring callbacks: code "
"and data cannot be freed before mask/STOP, synchronous cancellation, and callback drain complete. "
"Global table locks protect only short transactions and are not held across ELF I/O, "
"initialization, waits, or device callbacks. Prohibit repeated initialization, concurrent same-name"
" loads, dependency cycles, and new references during unloading. Registrations during init carry "
"owners and obey state admission; external tasks cannot enter COMING modules without valid pins. On"
" init failure, close admission and drain entered executors before revoking registrations and code;"
" do not free immediately just because init returned an error."

msgid ""
"卸载先拒绝新绑定、检查引用，再停设备、排空 IRQ/工作及移除注册，最后 撤销代码映射。根磁盘、已挂载文件系统、打开的音频/DRM 设备或保留的映射 应拒绝卸载；没有安全 exit "
"的模块也不能强制移除。设备 STOP 失败时必须 保留仍会执行的代码和 DMA 所有权，并显示真实错误，不能制造成功卸载。"
msgstr ""
"Unloading first denies new bindings and checks references, then stops devices, drains IRQs/work, "
"and removes registrations, finally revoking code mappings. Root disks, mounted filesystems, open "
"audio/DRM devices, and retained mappings should reject unloading; modules without safe exit cannot"
" be forcibly removed. Device STOP failure must retain executable code and DMA ownership and expose"
" the real error, never fabricate successful unloading."

msgid ""
"实现 Linux 编号的 ``init_module``、``finit_module``、``delete_module``， 要求 "
"``CAP_SYS_MODULE``。参数、标志、错误码及权限/坏指针的检查顺序逐项 对照 Linux 6.12。未知或未实现的 flags 明确拒绝，不忽略校验。 提供 "
"``/proc/modules``、``/sys/module/<name>``、参数及引用信息；内置状态 与外置加载状态分别表示，不能把“模块已注册”误报成“发现并激活设备”。"
msgstr ""
"Implement Linux-numbered ``init_module``, ``finit_module``, and ``delete_module`` with "
"``CAP_SYS_MODULE`` required. Compare parameters, flags, error codes, and permission/bad-pointer "
"check order individually against Linux 6.12. Explicitly reject unknown or unimplemented flags, "
"without skipping validation. Expose ``/proc/modules``, ``/sys/module/<name>``, parameters, and "
"reference information. Distinguish built-in status from external loading status; do not misreport "
"module registration as device discovery and activation."

msgid "产物与 ABI 身份"
msgstr "Artifacts and ABI Identity"

msgid ""
"使用原版 Linux 6.12 的 obj-m、复合对象、modpost 和 modfinal 规则，补齐 其 host 工具和头文件依赖闭包，记录上游来源、哈希和许可证。不改导入的 "
"构建引擎来绕过错误，项目适配放在本地 Makefile 片段。"
msgstr ""
"Use upstream Linux 6.12 obj-m, composite object, modpost, and modfinal rules, supply their "
"complete host-tool/header dependency closure, and record upstream sources, hashes, and licenses. "
"Do not modify imported engines to bypass errors; keep project adaptation in local Makefile "
"fragments."

msgid ""
"新增 ``modules``、``modules_install``、``modules_prepare``、 ``allmodconfig``、``allyesconfig``；``all`` "
"同时产出所选模块。 生成 ``Module.symvers``、``modules.order``、``modules.builtin``、 ``modules.builtin.modinfo``"
" 和 ``.modinfo``；默认提供导出符号类型 CRC 校验，不声称稳定的跨内核模块二进制 ABI。"
msgstr ""
"Add ``modules``, ``modules_install``, ``modules_prepare``, ``allmodconfig``, and ``allyesconfig``;"
" ``all`` also produces selected modules. Generate ``Module.symvers``, ``modules.order``, "
"``modules.builtin``, ``modules.builtin.modinfo``, and ``.modinfo``. Exported-symbol type CRC "
"checks are enabled by default; no stable cross-kernel module binary ABI is claimed."

msgid ""
"同一 release 数字的不同源码/ABI 配置不能共用一个可覆盖的模块目录。 建议自动形成带 ABI 身份后缀的 ``KERNELRELEASE``，由 release、用户版本 "
"后缀和源码/ABI 配置/工具链指纹共同决定；数字版本及 OS VERSION_ID 不变。 最长 31 字节约束继续有效，超长须报错。该 ABI 指纹不能依赖编译时间或 产生 "
"build_info/符号 CRC 的循环依赖。模块必须匹配完整 KERNELRELEASE 和导出符号版本；默认不允许跳过检查。"
msgstr ""
"Different source/ABI configurations with the same release number must not share an overwritable "
"module directory. Propose automatic ABI-suffixed ``KERNELRELEASE`` based on release, user version "
"suffixes, and source/ABI configuration/toolchain fingerprints; numeric version and OS VERSION_ID "
"stay unchanged. The 31-byte maximum remains, with errors on overflow. The ABI fingerprint must not"
" depend on compilation time or create circular dependencies with build_info/symbol CRC generation."
" Modules must match full KERNELRELEASE and exported-symbol versions; checks cannot be skipped by "
"default."

msgid ""
"安装到 ``/lib/modules/<KERNELRELEASE>/kernel/``，附模块元数据、配置及 ABI 清单。prepared SDK 为树外模块提供匹配的头文件、生成配置和 "
"symvers。 切换 ``m -> y/n`` 后，只清理本输出/安装清单拥有的陈旧模块，不动其他版本 和用户外置模块。关闭 MODULES 的全内置构建也必须成立。"
msgstr ""
"Install under ``/lib/modules/<KERNELRELEASE>/kernel/`` with module metadata, configuration, and "
"ABI manifests. The prepared SDK supplies matching headers, generated configuration, and symvers "
"for out-of-tree modules. After ``m -> y/n``, clean only stale modules owned by this "
"output/installation manifest, preserving other versions and user external modules. A fully built-"
"in build with MODULES disabled must also work."

msgid "实施顺序与可检查结果"
msgstr "Implementation Order and Reviewable Results"

msgid "K1：模块契约与配置骨架"
msgstr "K1: Module Contracts and Configuration Skeleton"

msgid ""
"文件：上述新头文件、``kernel/module/Kconfig``、根 Kconfig、各子系统 "
"Kconfig、``arch/x86_64/configs/reliefnt_defconfig``。"
msgstr ""
"Files: the new headers above, ``kernel/module/Kconfig``, root Kconfig, subsystem Kconfig files, "
"and ``arch/x86_64/configs/reliefnt_defconfig``."

msgid ""
"[x] 先增加 ``tools/test_module_config.py``：默认无生产 ``=m``、禁用 MODULES 后 m 不可选、依赖不允许 y 引用 m，未知选项不伪装可用。"
msgstr ""
"[x] First add ``tools/test_module_config.py``: no production ``=m`` by default, m unavailable with"
" MODULES disabled, dependencies forbid y referencing m, and unknown options are not presented as "
"available."

msgid "[x] 定义参数、元数据、初始化和符号版本契约；先只接入测试模块开关。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Define parameter, metadata, initialization, and symbol version contracts; initially connect "
"only the test-module switch."

msgid "[x] 运行 ``make test-kconfig`` 和新配置测试，验证 defconfig 幂等。"
msgstr "[x] Run ``make test-kconfig`` and new configuration tests to verify defconfig idempotence."

msgid "K2：模块内存与 ELF/重定位"
msgstr "K2: Module Memory and ELF/Relocation"

msgid ""
"文件：``kernel/module/{elf,layout}.c``、``arch/x86_64/module/{memory,relocate}.c``、 "
"``include/reliefnt/paging.h``、``arch/x86_64/mm/paging.c``、``mm/physical/mm.c``。"
msgstr ""
"Files: ``kernel/module/{elf,layout}.c``, ``arch/x86_64/module/{memory,relocate}.c``, "
"``include/reliefnt/paging.h``, ``arch/x86_64/mm/paging.c``, and ``mm/physical/mm.c``."

msgid ""
"[x] 先增加 ``tools/test_module_elf.py``：真实工具链 ET_REL、损坏节表、 错误索引/长度、NOBITS、跨节 RELA、地址溢出、分配失败完整回滚。"
msgstr ""
"[x] First add ``tools/test_module_elf.py``: real-toolchain ET_REL, corrupt section tables, invalid"
" indices/lengths, NOBITS, cross-section RELA, address overflow, and full rollback on allocation "
"failure."

msgid ""
"[x] 增加 ``tools/test_module_memory.py``：先创建进程再加载、fork 后可见、 W^X 与直映射别名、跨 CPU TLB，并拒绝将模块静态区误用为连续 "
"DMA/PFN。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Add ``tools/test_module_memory.py``: processes created before loading, visibility after fork, "
"W^X and direct-map aliases, cross-CPU TLBs, and rejection of module static regions misused as "
"contiguous DMA/PFN."

msgid "[x] 实现共享映射和严格重定位；验证 large code model，不给不支持的 relocation 返回成功。旧低地址内核洞和用户空间边界保持原样。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Implement shared mappings and strict relocation; verify the large code model and never report "
"success for unsupported relocations. Preserve the old low-address kernel hole and userspace "
"boundaries."

msgid "K3：符号、状态机与 Linux syscall"
msgstr "K3: Symbols, State Machine, and Linux Syscalls"

msgid ""
"文件：``kernel/module/{symbols,params,lifecycle,info}.c``、 "
"``kernel/syscall/system/modules.c``、syscall dispatch、procfs/sysfs。"
msgstr ""
"Files: ``kernel/module/{symbols,params,lifecycle,info}.c``, ``kernel/syscall/system/modules.c``, "
"syscall dispatch, and procfs/sysfs."

msgid ""
"[x] 增加 ``tools/test_module_lifecycle.py`` 和 "
"``tools/tests/kmodules/{provider,consumer,init_fail,busy}.c``。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Add ``tools/test_module_lifecycle.py`` and "
"``tools/tests/kmodules/{provider,consumer,init_fail,busy}.c``."

msgid ""
"[x] 覆盖依赖引用、重复加载、未知符号、版本不符、并发 load/unload、 初始化失败、初始化中嵌套请求，以及回调排空失败时保留代码；证明自有 "
"注册不会形成无法卸载的自引用，真正的外部使用仍正确返回 busy。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Cover dependency references, duplicate loads, unknown symbols, version mismatches, concurrent "
"load/unload, init failure, nested init requests, and retaining code on callback-drain failure. "
"Prove owned registrations do not create un-unloadable self-references while real external use "
"still correctly returns busy."

msgid ""
"[x] 接入三个 syscall、CAP_SYS_MODULE 和信息接口。宿主只跑隔离 fixture； 真实模块装卸仅在私有 ReliefOS 来宾测试，不操作宿主 Linux 内核。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Connect the three syscalls, CAP_SYS_MODULE, and information interfaces. Host runs use isolated"
" fixtures only; real module loading/unloading runs solely in private ReliefOS guests, without "
"operating on the host Linux kernel."

msgid "K4：完整 Kbuild 模块链"
msgstr "K4: Complete Kbuild Module Chain"

msgid ""
"文件：根 Makefile/Kbuild、``scripts/Makefile.{reliefnt,module,products}``、 新增原版 "
"``scripts/mod/``、``scripts/genksyms/`` 及已校验依赖，更新来源清单。"
msgstr ""
"Files: root Makefile/Kbuild, ``scripts/Makefile.{reliefnt,module,products}``, newly imported "
"upstream ``scripts/mod/``, ``scripts/genksyms/`` and verified dependencies; update the source "
"manifest."

msgid ""
"[x] 增加 ``tools/test_kbuild_modules.py``：测试 provider/consumer 的 y、m、 n 与复合模块、缺失导出及符号 CRC，先验证真实 "
"modpost 失败诊断。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Add ``tools/test_kbuild_modules.py`` for provider/consumer y, m, n, composite modules, missing"
" exports, and symbol CRCs; first verify actual modpost failure diagnostics."

msgid "[x] 实现 modules/modules_install/modules_prepare 和完整产品 manifest。"
msgstr "[x] Implement modules/modules_install/modules_prepare and a complete product manifest."

msgid "[x] 覆盖 m-y-n 切换、源文件删除、清单陈旧项、O= 隔离、并发输出锁、 空模块集和源代码归档构建；保留既有 kernel.sys/debug 输出地址。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Cover m-y-n transitions, source deletion, stale manifest entries, O= isolation, concurrent "
"output locks, empty module sets, and source-archive builds; retain existing kernel.sys/debug "
"output locations."

msgid "[x] 改造 ``tools/test_module_layout.py``，理解配置和复合对象，继续校验 全部生产源码归属及导入引擎哈希，不能删去原有覆盖审计。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Adapt ``tools/test_module_layout.py`` to understand configuration and composite objects while "
"retaining all production source ownership and imported-engine hash checks; do not remove existing "
"coverage audits."

msgid "K5：设备注册与真实驱动模块化"
msgstr "K5: Device Registration and Real Driver Modularization"

msgid ""
"文件：``kernel/device/``、PCI/块设备注册、``drivers/**/Kconfig`` 与各目录 Kbuild、相关 syscall "
"设备分发、``fs/vfs/mount.c``。"
msgstr ""
"Files: ``kernel/device/``, PCI/block registration, ``drivers/**/Kconfig`` and directory Kbuild "
"files, related syscall device dispatch, and ``fs/vfs/mount.c``."

msgid "[x] 建立带 owner 的设备/块设备/file-ops 注册；把启动阶段直接调用的 AHCI/IDE/NVMe 扫描从通用根挂载中移回各驱动。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Establish owner-bearing device/block/file-ops registration; move direct boot-time "
"AHCI/IDE/NVMe scans from generic root mounting back into each driver."

msgid "[x] 先以 e1000 完成一个 y/m 双路径，再转换声卡、存储、输入、USB、 串口和 GPU。缺少硬件时注册成功但不绑定设备，避免无硬件就让模块初始化失败。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Complete one y/m dual path with e1000 first, then convert audio, storage, input, USB, serial, "
"and GPU. Without hardware, registration succeeds without device binding rather than failing module"
" initialization."

msgid ""
"[x] 将静态 DMA、BDL/ring 和用户映射的 PCM status/control 迁移到显式 backing 分配，验证 32 位 DMA mask、128 KiB ring、逐页 "
"mmap 与 owner 保活。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Migrate static DMA, BDL/rings, and user-mapped PCM status/control to explicit backing "
"allocation; verify 32-bit DMA masks, 128 KiB rings, per-page mmap, and owner lifetime retention."

msgid ""
"[x] 每个驱动先补对应 owner、IRQ/DMA、open/VMA 和错误撤销测试，再开放 m。 DRM fence、音频 STOP、网络回调和 USB 定时工作必须有真实退出边界。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Before enabling m, add each driver's owner, IRQ/DMA, open/VMA, and failure rollback tests. DRM"
" fences, audio STOP, network callbacks, and USB timed work require real exit boundaries."

msgid "[x] builtin 与 module 对相同硬件使用同一个 init/probe/注册入口；删除 硬编码内置名单以及指向已去除静态实现的直接引用。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Built-in and module variants use the same init/probe/registration entry for identical "
"hardware; remove hardcoded built-in lists and direct references to removed static implementations."

msgid "K6a：挂载树与任务路径引用"
msgstr "K6a: Mount Tree and Task Path References"

msgid ""
"文件：新增 ``include/reliefnt/mount.h``、``fs/vfs/{mount_tree,path}.c``， 修改 "
"``fs/vfs/storage_backend.c``、公共路径解析、任务 root/cwd、dirfd 和挂载实现。"
msgstr ""
"Files: new ``include/reliefnt/mount.h`` and ``fs/vfs/{mount_tree,path}.c``; modify "
"``fs/vfs/storage_backend.c``, common path resolution, task root/cwd, dirfd, and mount "
"implementations."

msgid ""
"[x] 先增加 ``tools/test_mount_tree.py``：父子挂载、覆盖挂载、MS_MOVE、 任务 root/cwd、dirfd、跨挂载路径解析，以及仍持有旧根的路径/文件引用。"
msgstr ""
"[x] First add ``tools/test_mount_tree.py``: parent/child mounts, overmounts, MS_MOVE, task "
"root/cwd, dirfd, cross-mount resolution, and path/file references still holding the old root."

msgid ""
"[x] 选择真正的带引用挂载树：``struct path`` 绑定 mount 与节点，mount 固定文件系统 owner；首版各任务共享一个挂载 namespace，但分别持有自己的 "
"root/cwd。暂不新增私有 mount namespace 功能开关。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Choose a real reference-counted mount tree: ``struct path`` binds a mount and node, and the "
"mount pins the filesystem owner. Initially all tasks share one mount namespace but hold their own "
"root/cwd; add no private mount namespace feature switch yet."

msgid ""
"[x] 现有 volume 数据继续作为 FS 后端；不再以 mount_path 文本前缀管理 挂载生命周期。迁移普通 mount、umount、chroot 与 proc 挂载视图；不保留 "
"一套供 initramfs 特用、无法解释普通进程路径的平行根路由。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Keep existing volume data as the FS backend; stop managing mount lifecycle by mount_path "
"string prefixes. Migrate normal mount, umount, chroot, and proc mount views; do not retain a "
"parallel root route only for initramfs that cannot explain ordinary process paths."

msgid "[x] 证明旧行为与权限保持，再开展 K6b/K7；任务退出、fork、openat 和 MS_MOVE 失败回滚均须释放正确路径引用。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Prove existing behavior and permissions are preserved before K6b/K7; task exit, fork, openat, "
"and MS_MOVE failure rollback must release the correct path references."

msgid "K6b：文件系统、sound/DRM core 与可选服务"
msgstr "K6b: Filesystems, sound/DRM Core, and Optional Services"

msgid ""
"文件：``fs/vfs/``、新增 ``include/reliefnt/fs_type.h``、各文件系统 Kconfig/ "
"Kbuild、``block/install/``、``sound/``、``drivers/video/drm/``、可选服务。"
msgstr ""
"Files: ``fs/vfs/``, new ``include/reliefnt/fs_type.h``, filesystem Kconfig/Kbuild files, "
"``block/install/``, ``sound/``, ``drivers/video/drm/``, and optional services."

msgid ""
"[x] 在 K6a 挂载树上建立 ``register_filesystem``/``unregister_filesystem`` 的 owner 注册， mount、inode/OFD、VMA"
" 和在途 I/O 固定实现；格式化/缓存失效也经对应 ops。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Build owner-based ``register_filesystem``/``unregister_filesystem`` registration on K6a's "
"mount tree. Mounts, inodes/OFDs, VMAs, and in-flight I/O pin implementations; formatting/cache "
"invalidation also use corresponding ops."

msgid "[x] 提取真实公共 ext 帮助代码并声明依赖，消除 VFS 对未启用文件系统的 直接函数/全局数据引用。分别验证每种 FS 的 y/m/n 与挂载中卸载拒绝。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Extract real common ext helpers and declare dependencies, removing VFS direct function/global-"
"data references to disabled filesystems. Validate each FS's y/m/n and rejection of unloading while"
" mounted."

msgid "[x] ALSA/DRM ioctl、poll 与 mmap 通过通用 file-ops 分发后，才允许其 core 为 m；不得用一组永远返回成功的空函数代替缺失实现。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Allow sound/DRM cores to be m only after ALSA/DRM ioctl, poll, and mmap use generic file-ops "
"dispatch; never replace missing implementations with stubs that always return success."

msgid "[x] 公布最终模块化目录矩阵；没有独立安全边界的核心保留内置并说明原因。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Publish the final modularization directory matrix; keep cores without independent safe "
"boundaries built in and explain why."

msgid "K7：初始内存根与切换真实根"
msgstr "K7: Initial Memory Root and Switching to the Real Root"

msgid ""
"文件：新增 ``fs/initramfs/``、``kernel/init/``、Multiboot2 模块分类、 ``fs/vfs/{mount_tree,path,initial}.c`` 与"
" mount/chroot/exec 路径、块设备 boot-module 后端。"
msgstr ""
"Files: new ``fs/initramfs/``, ``kernel/init/``, Multiboot2 module classification, "
"``fs/vfs/{mount_tree,path,initial}.c`` and mount/chroot/exec paths, and the block-device boot-"
"module backend."

msgid ""
"[x] 基于 K6a/K6b 增加 ``tools/test_initramfs.py`` 和 ``test_root_switch.py``：newc "
"边界、路径与链接、设备节点、模块物理地址、截断档案、旧根引用与清理。"
msgstr ""
"[x] On K6a/K6b, add ``tools/test_initramfs.py`` and ``test_root_switch.py``: newc bounds, "
"paths/links, device nodes, module physical addresses, truncated archives, old-root references, and"
" cleanup."

msgid ""
"[x] 将外置 newc 档案解包到内置初始根，执行 ``/init`` 作为 PID 1。 实现并验证用户态 switch_root 所需 mount-move/chroot/exec "
"语义，不能只 更换一个全局根指针。``init=`` 与 ``rdinit=`` 职责分开。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Unpack an external newc archive into the built-in initial root and execute ``/init`` as PID 1."
" Implement and verify mount-move/chroot/exec semantics needed by userspace switch_root, not merely"
" replacement of a global root pointer. Separate the roles of ``init=`` and ``rdinit=``."

msgid "[x] 安装器 ext4 大载荷保留为单独 Multiboot 模块，注册内存块设备后由 早期用户态挂载；不得让 ext4 模块依赖先挂载它自己，或复制 1.5 GiB 载荷。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Keep the installer's large ext4 payload as a separate Multiboot module, registered as a memory"
" block device and mounted by early userspace. Do not make the ext4 module depend on mounting "
"itself or copy the 1.5 GiB payload."

msgid "[x] 全内置且无 initramfs 的独立内核启动仍走有效的直接根挂载路径； 两种入口共用已注册设备/FS，不保留第二套旧硬编码扫描实现。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Standalone fully built-in boot without initramfs retains a working direct-root-mount path. "
"Both entries share registered devices/FSs without retaining a second legacy hardcoded scan "
"implementation."

msgid "K8：内核验收与手册收尾"
msgstr "K8: Kernel Acceptance and Manual Completion"

msgid ""
"[x] 将新测试登记 ``tools/tests/host-suites.list``；内核探针归本仓，QEMU 编排归父仓。分别验证 "
"debug/release、全内置、混合、allmodconfig、MODULES=n。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Register new tests in ``tools/tests/host-suites.list``. Kernel probes belong here and QEMU "
"orchestration in the parent. Validate debug/release, fully built-in, mixed, allmodconfig, and "
"MODULES=n separately."

msgid ""
"[x] 记录现有 10 个宿主失败及 driver ABI golden 未决状态，不重生成 golden 或改音频 manifest 来制造通过；新失败必须修复并保留 RED/GREEN 证据。"
" 最终完整回归为 147/156 通过：三个仍在使用的历史安装根别名补充品牌 allowlist 后，该项通过，其余 9 项失败的具体诊断与前次记录一致。 保留原始 10 "
"项失败记录，不将旧回归结果改写为通过。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Record the existing 10 host failures and unresolved driver ABI golden status; do not "
"regenerate golden data or alter the audio manifest to manufacture passes. Fix new failures and "
"retain RED/GREEN evidence. The final full regression passed 147/156: the branding check passed "
"after adding three still-used historical installation-root aliases to its allowlist; the other 9 "
"failures had the same specific diagnostics as previously recorded. Retain the original 10-failure "
"record rather than rewriting old regression results as passes."

msgid ""
"[x] 验证 default 与全模块构建的性能对照及原生资源/TCP 探针；large code model 下的模块路径单独记录性能，不因可加载而忽略明显退化。 同一 "
"QEMU/KVM、BIOS、1 vCPU、AHCI、4 GiB 配置，预热后各测五次 完整 2 GiB yes/dd；全模块与 default 的中位吞吐比为 0.9979，两组相对 标准差均低于"
" 2.4%。资源容量、映射生命周期及独立 TCP 对端的数据核对 分别通过；计时 VM 内不编译探针。该结果只覆盖本次虚拟平台和工作负载， 不代表任意硬件或所有操作都没有性能差异。 "
"没有本次改造前同环境的计时基线，不能据此断言相对旧内核无性能退化。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Validate performance comparisons of default and all-module builds plus native resource/TCP "
"probes. Record large-code-model module-path performance separately; loadability does not justify "
"ignoring clear regressions. With the same QEMU/KVM, BIOS, 1 vCPU, AHCI, and 4 GiB configuration, "
"run a complete 2 GiB yes/dd five times per build after warmup. The all-module/default median "
"throughput ratio was 0.9979, with relative standard deviations below 2.4% for both. Resource "
"capacity, mapping lifecycle, and independent TCP-peer data checks passed separately; do not "
"compile probes inside the timed VM. These results cover only this virtual platform and workload, "
"not arbitrary hardware or every operation. No same-environment timing baseline predates this "
"rework, so no conclusion of zero regression against the old kernel is justified."

msgid ""
"[x] 更新 core-api/drivers、modules、kbuild 手册；删除“所有组件永远静态 链接”等已失效描述，不改写历史 release 事实。严格构建 RST 文档。"
msgstr ""
"[x] Update core-api/drivers, modules, and kbuild manuals; remove obsolete claims such as “all "
"components are always statically linked” without rewriting historical release facts. Build RST "
"documentation strictly."

msgid "验收门槛"
msgstr "Acceptance Criteria"

msgid ""
"不能仅凭生成 .ko 或 modinfo 能读取信息宣布完成。必须由父仓测试证实： 默认全内置、混合模块，以及全部可模块化部件为 m 的镜像可启动；根控制器 与根文件系统均为 m "
"的组合能进入真实用户态和桌面；busy 卸载被拒绝，空闲 模块能循环装卸，损坏模块被拒绝且系统仍可继续工作。"
msgstr ""
"Generating .ko files or reading modinfo alone is insufficient to declare completion. Parent-"
"repository tests must establish that default fully built-in, mixed, and all-modularizable-"
"components-at-m images boot; that m for both root controller and root filesystem reaches real "
"userspace and the desktop; that busy unloads are rejected, idle modules cycle through load/unload,"
" and corrupt modules are rejected while the system remains operational."

msgid ""
"“不因模块化出错”指合法依赖配置和受支持设备，不代表磁盘缺文件、OOM、 不匹配 ABI 或故障硬件也必须成功。这些情况须准确报错并保留恢复入口。 "
"QEMU、VMware、真实硬件分别报告；VMware 验证未完成时必须明示。"
msgstr ""
"“No failures caused by modularization” applies to valid dependency configurations and supported "
"devices; it does not require success with missing disk files, OOM, incompatible ABI, or faulty "
"hardware. Report such cases accurately and preserve recovery entry points. Report QEMU, VMware, "
"and physical hardware separately, explicitly stating when VMware validation is incomplete."

msgid "规范参考"
msgstr "Specification References"

msgid "`Kbuild 模块规则 <https://docs.kernel.org/kbuild/modules.html>`_"
msgstr "`Kbuild module rules <https://docs.kernel.org/kbuild/modules.html>`_"

